  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For some strange reason, after crusaders mass reported my friends, their public bans never end nor do they progress. So an example of this bug is theoretically, I get a public ban today (5/11/2021) and the ban today says that it will allow me to be free in a month (6/11/2021). Tomorrow it will tell me that the ban ends in a month again (6/12/2021) meaning that either the timer never starts, or either resets every day. I know this is a bug because my one friend had his public ban immediately appealed by a moderator, and it went from a month, to a day. It is now permanently stuck at \"the ban ends tomorrow\" and it never does. I am not effected by this bug, but 2 of my friends are, and they have not been able to go to public for a long time. I have even seen other users complain about this on the Discord server, not just the 2 friends who were attacked by crusaders. To recreate this (which you definitely don't want to do)  have people mass report you for the same reason, and receive a public ban. This will result in the endless public ban.",
